- Use Tailwind utility classes and `tailwind-merge` for conflict resolution
- Build components with shadcn/ui primitives and Radix where applicable
- Favor composition over deep prop drilling; extract small presentational parts
- Ensure accessibility: keyboard navigation, ARIA labels, contrast
- Keep responsive design mobile-first; test dark/light themes
- Co-locate small helpers with components; keep reusable primitives under `src/components`
